# 🛒 E-Commerce Product Categorizer AI

AI model that predicts product category from product name.

*Live Demo:* https://e-commerce-categorizer.onrender.com

*Tech:* Python, Flask, Scikit-learn, Render

*How to use:*
1. Enter product name e.g. "iphone 15, nike shoes"
2. Click Predict Category
3. AI shows category
